{"attack":"在5回合内连续滚动攻击对手。招式每次击中，威力就会提高。","description":"攻击目标造成伤害。\n使用者在接下来的4回合会继续使用滚动进行攻击，无法使用其他招式、使用道具、替换宝可梦或逃走。\n后续的4次攻击的威力分别提升为2倍、4倍、8倍和16倍。\n因梦话而使用时，不会继续攻击，也不会提升后续攻击的威力。\n因守住状态、未命中、属性相性无效等原因而没有产生效果时，不再继续攻击，威力提升效果消失。\n使用者进入飞翔状态时，仅在当回合中断攻击。飞翔状态解除后，若尚未经过4回合，会继续使用滚动进行攻击。\n因飞翔状态中断攻击导致后续4回合中没有攻击4次时，威力提升效果保留，会增加后续使出的任何攻击招式的威力。这是一个游戏漏洞。\n如果在对战中自身曾使用变圆，则该招式威力还会再次翻倍。\n后续回合的攻击不消耗ＰＰ。","levelUpMoves":[{"Name":"Sandshrew","Level":9},{"Name":"Sandshrew form:alolan","Level":9},{"Name":"Sandslash","Level":9},{"Name":"Geodude","Level":10},{"Name":"Geodude form:alolan","Level":10},{"Name":"Graveler","Level":10},{"Name":"Graveler form:alolan","Level":10},{"Name":"Voltorb","Level":11},{"Name":"Voltorb form:hisuian","Level":11},{"Name":"Electrode","Level":11},{"Name":"Electrode form:hisuian","Level":11},{"Name":"Lickitung","Level":6},{"Name":"Omanyte","Level":5},{"Name":"Omastar","Level":0},{"Name":"Cyndaquil","Level":49},{"Name":"Quilava","Level":57},{"Name":"Typhlosion","Level":61},{"Name":"Typhlosion form:hisuian","Level":61},{"Name":"Marill","Level":0},{"Name":"Azumarill","Level":0},{"Name":"Pineco","Level":20},{"Name":"Forretress","Level":20},{"Name":"Dunsparce","Level":8},{"Name":"Shuckle","Level":5},{"Name":"Phanpy","Level":10},{"Name":"Donphan","Level":10},{"Name":"Miltank","Level":5},{"Name":"Seedot","Level":12},{"Name":"Nuzleaf","Level":12},{"Name":"Spheal","Level":0},{"Name":"Sealeo","Level":0},{"Name":"Walrein","Level":0},{"Name":"Bidoof","Level":9},{"Name":"Bidoof form:sirdoofusiii","Level":9},{"Name":"Bibarel","Level":9},{"Name":"Lickilicky","Level":0},{"Name":"Tepig","Level":21},{"Name":"Pignite","Level":23},{"Name":"Emboar","Level":23},{"Name":"Venipede","Level":4},{"Name":"Whirlipede","Level":0},{"Name":"Scolipede","Level":0},{"Name":"Chespin","Level":8},{"Name":"Quilladin","Level":8},{"Name":"Chesnaught","Level":0},{"Name":"Minior form:meteor","Level":8},{"Name":"Minior form:core","Level":8},{"Name":"Komala","Level":0},{"Name":"Magearna","Level":12},{"Name":"Magearn